<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es" class="dark">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Git Master Hub - Guía Interactiva y Simulador Sin Miedo</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- FontAwesome Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
    <!-- Google Fonts: Inter & Fira Code -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fira+Code:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            darkMode: 'class',
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    fontFamily: {
                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],
                        mono: ['Fira Code', 'monospace'],
                    },
                    colors: {
                        gh: {
                            bg: '#0d1117',
                            card: '#161b22',
                            border: '#30363d',
                            text: '#c9d1d9',
                            muted: '#8b949e',
                            accent: '#58a6ff',
                            success: '#238636',
                            warning: '#d29922',
                            danger: '#f85149',
                            purple: '#8957e5'
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>

    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #0d1117;
            color: #c9d1d9;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }
        /* Scrollbar personalizada estilo VS Code */
        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #0d1117;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #30363d;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
            background: #58a6ff;
        }
        /* Animaciones de flujo */
        @keyframes pulseGlow {
            0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(88, 166, 255, 0.25); }
            50% { box-shadow: 0 0 28px rgba(88, 166, 255, 0.65); }
        }
        .glow-active {
            animation: pulseGlow 2s infinite;
            border-color: #58a6ff !important;
        }
        @keyframes packetFly {
            0% { transform: scale(0.8); opacity: 0; }
            20% { transform: scale(1.05); opacity: 1; }
            80% { transform: scale(1.05); opacity: 1; }
            100% { transform: scale(0.9); opacity: 0; }
        }
        .commit-node {
            transition: all 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
        }
        .commit-node:hover {
            filter: drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(88, 166, 255, 0.8));
        }
        .terminal-cursor {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 8px;
            height: 16px;
            background-color: #58a6ff;
            animation: blink 1s step-end infinite;
            vertical-align: middle;
        }
        @keyframes blink {
            50% { opacity: 0; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col selection:bg-blue-500 selection:text-white">

    <!-- Notificación Toast Flotante -->
    <div id="toast-container" class="fixed bottom-5 right-5 z-50 flex flex-col gap-2 pointer-events-none"></div>

    <!-- Modal de Detalles / Demo -->
    <div id="command-modal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-sm z-50 hidden items-center justify-center p-4">
        <div class="bg-gh-card border border-gh-border rounded-2xl max-w-2xl w-full p-6 shadow-2xl transform transition-all">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-start border-b border-gh-border pb-4 mb-4">
                <div>
                    <span id="modal-badge" class="text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full"></span>
                    <h3 id="modal-title" class="text-2xl font-bold font-mono text-white mt-2"></h3>
                </div>
                <button onclick="closeModal()" class="text-gh-muted hover:text-white p-1.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-gh-border/50 transition">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-xl"></i>
                </button>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-4 text-sm">
                <div>
                    <h4 class="text-gh-accent font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs mb-1">En Español Claro (Uso en el trabajo)</h4>
                    <p id="modal-desc" class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-base"></p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-gh-bg border border-gh-border rounded-xl p-4">
                    <h4 class="text-gray-400 font-semibold text-xs uppercase mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-terminal text-gh-accent"></i> Opciones y Flags más usados en la vida real
                    </h4>
                    <div id="modal-flags" class="space-y-2 font-mono text-xs"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-blue-950/30 border border-blue-500/30 rounded-xl p-4">
                    <h4 class="text-blue-400 font-semibold text-xs uppercase mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb"></i> Consejo Profesional Sin Miedo
                    </h4>
                    <p id="modal-tip" class="text-blue-200 text-xs leading-relaxed"></p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-gh-border flex flex-wrap justify-end gap-3">
                <button onclick="closeModal()" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-gh-border text-gray-300 hover:bg-gh-border/40 text-sm font-medium transition">
                    Cerrar
                </button>
                <button id="modal-try-btn" class="px-5 py-2 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white text-sm font-semibold flex items-center gap-2 shadow-lg shadow-blue-600/30 transition">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-play"></i> Probar este Comando en el Simulador
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Header Principal -->
    <header class="sticky top-0 z-40 bg-gh-bg/90 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-gh-border">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-500 to-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-orange-500/20">
                    <i class="fa-brands fa-git-alt text-white text-2xl"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                        <h1 class="font-extrabold text-lg sm:text-xl tracking-tight text-white">Git Master <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 to-emerald-400">Hub</span></h1>
                        <span class="hidden sm:inline-block text-[10px] font-mono uppercase bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">Modo Sin Miedo</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gh-muted hidden sm:block">Aprende, visualiza y simula todos los comandos de Git antes de usarlos en tu trabajo</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Navegación por Pestañas / Secciones -->
            <nav class="flex items-center gap-1 sm:gap-2 bg-gh-card p-1 rounded-xl border border-gh-border">
                <button onclick="switchSection('visualizer')" id="nav-visualizer" class="nav-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium transition flex items-center gap-2 bg-blue-600 text-white shadow">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-diagram-project"></i> <span class="hidden md:inline">1. Las 4 Áreas</span>
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchSection('simulator')" id="nav-simulator" class="nav-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-gh-muted hover:text-white transition flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-code-branch"></i> <span class="hidden md:inline">2. Simulador + Grafo</span>
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchSection('catalog')" id="nav-catalog" class="nav-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-gh-muted hover:text-white transition flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-book-open"></i> <span class="hidden md:inline">3. Todos los Comandos</span>
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchSection('panic')" id="nav-panic" class="nav-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-red-400 hover:bg-red-500/10 transition flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-life-ring animate-pulse"></i> <span class="hidden md:inline">4. Salvavidas SOS</span>
                </button>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Contenido Principal -->
    <main class="flex-grow max-w-7xl w-full mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-6 space-y-8">

        <!-- Banner de Bienvenida Rápida -->
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-950/60 via-gh-card to-purple-950/40 border border-gh-border rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5 flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start lg:items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-500/20 border border-blue-400/30 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-lg"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-sm sm:text-base">¿Miedo a romper el repositorio de tu empresa? Aquí nada se rompe.</h2>
                    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gh-muted mt-0.5">El 95% del miedo a Git viene de no ver qué pasa por dentro. Usa las pestañas superiores para ver cómo viajan tus archivos, practicar ramas en vivo o usar el botón de pánico si tuviste un accidente.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0 self-end lg:self-center">
                <span class="text-xs text-gh-muted">Acceso rápido:</span>
                <button onclick="switchSection('catalog')" class="text-xs bg-gh-border/60 hover:bg-gh-border text-white px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-mono transition">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass mr-1 text-blue-400"></i> Buscar comando
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchSection('panic')" class="text-xs bg-red-500/20 hover:bg-red-500/30 border border-red-500/40 text-red-300 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-semibold transition">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation mr-1"></i> ¡Cometí un error!
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ========================================================================= -->
        <!-- SECCIÓN 1: VISUALIZADOR DEL FLUJO DE LAS 4 ÁREAS DE GIT                   -->
        <!-- ========================================================================= -->
        <section id="section-visualizer" class="space-y-6">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-4">
                <div>
                    <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-400 font-semibold">Módulo 1 • Entendiendo la Arquitectura</span>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-1">Visualizador Interactivo de las 4 Zonas de Git</h2>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gh-muted">Haz clic en cualquier comando inferior para ver exactamente cómo se mueven tus archivos entre tu carpeta, el limbo (Staging), tu historial local y la nube (GitHub/GitLab).</p>
                </div>
                <button onclick="resetFlowVisualizer()" class="self-start md:self-auto px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl bg-gh-card border border-gh-border hover:border-gray-500 text-xs font-medium text-gray-300 flex items-center gap-2 transition">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-left"></i> Reiniciar Escenario
                </button>
            </div>

            <!-- Botonera de Acciones del Flujo -->
            <div class="bg-gh-card border border-gh-border rounded-2xl p-4">
                <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-gh-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-3 flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span>Haz clic en un comando para animar el viaje del código:</span>
                    <span id="flow-step-indicator" class="text-blue-400 font-mono">Estado: Listo para interactuar</span>
                </div>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-8 gap-2.5">
                    <button onclick="triggerFlowAction('edit')" class="flow-btn group p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-gh-bg border border-gh-border hover:border-amber-400/60 text-left transition flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                            <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-amber-400">1. Editar</span>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-pen-to-square text-amber-400/70 group-hover:scale-110 transition"></i>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-[11px] text-gh-muted mt-1">Modificar código</span>
                    </button>

                    <button onclick="triggerFlowAction('add')" class="flow-btn group p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-gh-bg border border-gh-border hover:border-emerald-400/60 text-left transition flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                            <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-emerald-400">git add .</span>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right text-emerald-400/70 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition"></i>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-[11px] text-gh-muted mt-1">Subir a Tarima</span>
                    </button>

                    <button onclick="triggerFlowAction('commit')" class="flow-btn group p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-gh-bg border border-gh-border hover:border-blue-400/60 text-left transition flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                            <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-blue-400">git commit</span>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-camera text-blue-400/70 group-hover:scale-110 transition"></i>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-[11px] text-gh-muted mt-1">Guardar foto local</span>
                    </button>

                    <button onclick="triggerFlowAction('push')" class="flow-btn group p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-gh-bg border border-gh-border hover:border-purple-400/60 text-left transition flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                            <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-purple-400">git push</span>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-cloud-arrow-up text-purple-400/70 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition"></i>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-[11px] text-gh-muted mt-1">Subir a GitHub</span>
                    </button>

                    <button onclick="triggerFlowAction('fetch')" class="flow-btn group p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-gh-bg border border-gh-border hover:border-cyan-400/60 text-left transition flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                            <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-cyan-400">git fetch</span>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-satellite-dish text-cyan-400/70 group-hover:rotate-12 transition"></i>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-[11px] text-gh-muted mt-1">Ver novedades</span>
                    </button>

                    <button onclick="triggerFlowAction('pull')" class="flow-btn group p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-gh-bg border border-gh-border hover:border-teal-400/60 text-left transition flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                            <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-teal-400">git pull</span>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-cloud-arrow-down text-teal-400/70 group-hover:translate-y-0.5 transition"></i>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-[11px] text-gh-muted mt-1">Traer a mi PC</span>
                    </button>

                    <button onclick="triggerFlowAction('restore')" class="flow-btn group p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-gh-bg border border-gh-border hover:border-orange-400/60 text-left transition flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                            <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-orange-400">git restore</span>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-eraser text-orange-400/70 transition"></i>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-[11px] text-gh-muted mt-1">Descartar cambio</span>
                    </button>

                    <button onclick="triggerFlowAction('reset')" class="flow-btn group p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-gh-bg border border-gh-border hover:border-red-400/60 text-left transition flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                            <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-red-400">git reset</span>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-backward-step text-red-400/70 transition"></i>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-[11px] text-gh-muted mt-1">Devolver commit</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Diagrama de las 4 Columnas Interactivas -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 relative">
                
                <!-- Zona 1: Working Directory -->
                <div id="zone-working" class="zone-card bg-gh-card border-2 border-gh-border rounded-2xl p-4 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[290px] transition-all duration-300">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gh-border pb-3">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-400">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-laptop-code"></i>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-sm">1. Working Directory</h3>
                                    <p class="text-[11px] text-gh-muted">Tu Carpeta de Trabajo (VS Code)</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-300 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Tu PC</span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gh-muted mt-3">Aquí editas tus archivos libremente. Git nota que los tocaste, pero <strong>aún no están listos</strong> para guardarse.</p>
                        
                        <!-- Contenedor de Archivos en Working Dir -->
                        <div id="files-working" class="mt-4 space-y-2"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-4 pt-2 border-t border-gh-border/60 flex justify-between items-center text-[11px] text-gh-muted">
                        <span>Analogía: <strong>Tu escritorio</strong></span>
                        <span class="font-mono text-amber-400">Untracked / Modified</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Zona 2: Staging Area / Index -->
                <div id="zone-staging" class="zone-card bg-gh-card border-2 border-gh-border rounded-2xl p-4 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[290px] transition-all duration-300">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gh-border pb-3">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-box-open"></i>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-sm">2. Staging Area (Index)</h3>
                                    <p class="text-[11px] text-gh-muted">Área de Preparación / Tarima</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-300 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Pre-Commit</span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gh-muted mt-3">Los archivos que elegiste con <code class="text-emerald-400">git add</code> para salir en la próxima foto (commit). Puedes quitar archivos si te arrepientes.</p>
                        
                        <!-- Contenedor de Archivos en Staging -->
                        <div id="files-staging" class="mt-4 space-y-2"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-4 pt-2 border-t border-gh-border/60 flex justify-between items-center text-[11px] text-gh-muted">
                        <span>Analogía: <strong>La pose para la foto</strong></span>
                        <span class="font-mono text-emerald-400">Staged</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Zona 3: Local Repository -->
                <div id="zone-local" class="zone-card bg-gh-card border-2 border-gh-border rounded-2xl p-4 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[290px] transition-all duration-300">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gh-border pb-3">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-400">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-database"></i>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-sm">3. Repositorio Local</h3>
                                    <p class="text-[11px] text-gh-muted">Carpeta oculta <code class="text-blue-400">.git</code> en tu PC</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-300 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Historial PC</span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gh-muted mt-3">Aquí viven todos tus <strong>commits</strong> seguros en tu disco duro. Tus compañeros aún no los ven hasta que hagas push.</p>
                        
                        <!-- Contenedor de Commits en Local -->
                        <div id="files-local" class="mt-4 space-y-2"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-4 pt-2 border-t border-gh-border/60 flex justify-between items-center text-[11px] text-gh-muted">
                        <span>Analogía: <strong>Álbum en tu casa</strong></span>
                        <span class="font-mono text-blue-400">Committed (HEAD)</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Zona 4: Remote Repository -->
                <div id="zone-remote" class="zone-card bg-gh-card border-2 border-gh-border rounded-2xl p-4 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[290px] transition-all duration-300">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gh-border pb-3">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-purple-400">
                                    <i class="fa-brands fa-github"></i>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-sm">4. Repositorio Remoto</h3>
                                    <p class="text-[11px] text-gh-muted">GitHub / GitLab / Bitbucket</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-300 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">origin/main</span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gh-muted mt-3">El servidor en la nube donde todo el equipo comparte su código. Lo que sube aquí con <code class="text-purple-400">git push</code> es visible para todos.</p>
                        
                        <!-- Contenedor de Commits en Remote -->
                        <div id="files-remote" class="mt-4 space-y-2"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-4 pt-2 border-t border-gh-border/60 flex justify-between items-center text-[11px] text-gh-muted">
                        <span>Analogía: <strong>Instagram del Equipo</strong></span>
                        <span class="font-mono text-purple-400">origin</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>

            <!-- Panel de Explicación en Vivo del Flujo -->
            <div id="flow-explanation-box" class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-950/40 to-gh-card border border-blue-500/40 rounded-2xl p-5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
                <div class="space-y-1">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span id="flow-cmd-tag" class="font-mono text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-300 border border-blue-400/30">Estado Inicial</span>
                        <h4 id="flow-exp-title" class="font-bold text-white text-base">Todo limpio y sincronizado</h4>
                    </div>
                    <p id="flow-exp-desc" class="text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
